请在D:\JavaProject\solution目录下执行以下命令之一来读取文件内容：

方法1 - PowerShell直接读取docx（推荐）:
```powershell
Add-Type -AssemblyName System.IO.Compression.FileSystem
$files = Get-ChildItem "D:\JavaProject\solution\*.docx" | Where-Object { $_.Name -like "*施工方案*" }
foreach ($f in $files) {
    $stream = [System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]::OpenRead($f.FullName)
    foreach ($entry in $stream.Entries) {
        if ($entry.Name -like "document.xml") {
            # Extract text from document.xml
            [xml]$doc = New-Object System.Xml.XmlDocument
            $reader = $entry.Open()
            $reader.ReadToDescendant("w:t") | Out-Null
            while ($reader.NodeType -eq [System.Xml.XmlNodeType]::Element) {
                if ($reader.Name -eq "w:t") { $text += $reader.GetAttribute('xml:space') + $reader.InnerText; $reader.Read(); break }
                else { $reader.Skip() }
            }
            Write-Output $text
        }
    }
}
```

方法2 - Python脚本读取docx和pdf:
```bash
# 先检查是否有python
python --version
# 然后安装必要库并读取
pip install python-docx PyPDF2
python -c "
from docx import Document
import sys
doc = Document(r'D:\\JavaProject\\solution\\双流机场东消防站维修工程施工方案-背景资料.docx')
for p in doc.paragraphs:
    print(p.text)
print('--- TABLES ---')
for table in doc.tables:
    for row in table.rows:
        print(' | '.join(cell.text for cell in row.cells))
"
python -c "
import PyPDF2
with open(r'D:\\JavaProject\\solution\\双流机场东消防站维修工程项目清单-背景资料.pdf', 'rb') as f:
    reader = PyPDF2.PdfReader(f)
    for page in reader.pages:
        print(page.extract_text())
"
```

